    - target: {fileID: 8858009408821190366, guid: 9c2fafdb9523da547a51f27c5a97b01a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s correct!\n\nSince the arrangement must begin with C, we
        fix C in the first position.\n\nNow only A and B remain to be placed.\n\nThose
        two runes can switch places, giving us:\n\nC A B\n\nC B A\n\nBoth arrangements
        satisfy the condition because they begin with C."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
